==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|матерья́л}}
* {{alt|ru|матеріа́лъ|матерья́лъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|la-lat|māteriālis||material (adjective)}} via {{bor|ru|de|Material}} or {{bor|ru|nl|materiaal}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|материа́л}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-материал.ogg}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=матерья́л}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|материа́л|adj=материа́льный|dim=материа́льчик}}

# [[material]] {{gl|matter from which physical things are made or which is otherwise used to create such things}}
#: {{hyper|ru|вещество́}}
#: {{hypo|ru|сырьё}}; ''see individual materials below''
# [[material]] {{gl|something, as data or an idea, that may be reworked into a new form or may serve as the basis for interpretations}}
# [[fabric]], [[material]]
#: {{syn|ru|мате́рия|ткань}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|материа́л}}

